      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ab7ecae704ec9014ba1ee30|full_name}: It's for texturing and viseme creation. you don't want your mouth closed when you do texture work or when you're trying to wrangle a mouth into different poses. \n\nThis somewhat confusing update has just made it so that if you do viseme work you need to close your mouth up when you're done which kinda sucks if you have a lot of shape keys or make your own models at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
