      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ae036cde69bb76ba5072775|full_name}: You already made the mouth closed with sil at 100 so at least it's easy to just rest your basis to the new format. I can sympathize since they never explained the \"correct\" way to set up visemes, however, this will probably be put on the players to fix especially since it's a rather quick one. How I've always seen it is Basis is at rest, and the mouth isn't open at rest so I closed the mouth.",
      "viewerReactions": null
